:"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566306:1":{"text":"さあ、よく覚えてないが二十年ぐらい前かな。今でも風が吹いたり雨が降ったりすると関節がうずくんだよ。","source_cn":"记不清了，总有十几二十年了，现在每逢刮风下雨骨头缝那其...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB020532D3F73EFAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566307:1":{"text":"それは仕方がないことだ。貴殿ほどではないが、私も湿気の多いとこに行くと傷がむず痒くなる。","source_cn":"难免的，我身上没你这么重的伤，到潮湿的地方也发痒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BAC336D0D378AFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566308:1":{"text":"ちなみにこの義手は、ある発明家が作ってくれたんだ。魔法も付与されていて、力を込めやすくなっている。","source_cn":"至于这假肢，是某位发明家帮我弄的，附带了魔法，能减轻发力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B74A37AC14B79C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566309:1":{"text":"だがそれでも、時間が経てば痛むものは痛むからな。こまめにストレッチをするしかない。","source_cn":"只不过用久了，该疼的地方也还是疼，只能自己多拉伸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DBADDCA85954DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566310:1":{"text":"そうだな。治癒魔法もせいぜい痛みを和らげるぐらいで、役に立たんことの方が多い。","source_cn":"是啊，治疗魔法最多也就止痛，经常派不上用场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4B1403BF792A890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"